  "title": "Sweet Potato and Brandy Soup",
  "description": "A wonderful sweet potato soup for chilly fall evenings that will have your home smelling of allspice and brandy. You may simply mash the sweet potatoes for a chunkier soup, or puree them until smooth and creamy.",
